25637519,14,Does the paper report HIV sequences from individuals who had previously received ARV drugs?,No,"The current study characterized a novel NNRTI-related mutation D404N in RT, which was selected previously by nevirapine during in vitro cell culture. A novel mutation, D404N, in the connection subdomain of reverse transcriptase of HIV-1 CRF08_BC subtype confers cross-resistance to NNRTIs. Materials and methods- Cells, plasmids and drugs. Abstract- Objectives.",The paper does not mention obtaining sequences from individuals who had previously received ARV drugs. It focuses on laboratory-generated mutations and their effects on drug resistance.
