35730213,8,Were samples cloned prior to sequencing?,No samples cloned,"HIV programmes across many countries in Africa have recently transitioned people living with HIV from efavirenz (EFV)- to dolutegravir (DTG)-containing antiretroviral therapy (ART). As both drugs are associated with neuropsychiatric adverse effects, this study assessed the mental health and HIV/ART-associated symptoms of people living with HIV before and after transition to DTG.",The paper does not mention any cloning of samples prior to sequencing because no sequencing was performed. The focus is on clinical outcomes rather than laboratory procedures.
