35730213,13,Were the patients in the study in a clinical trial?,Yes,"The prospective DO-REAL cohort enrolled people starting DTG-based ART in Lesotho from February to December 2020. For this analysis within DO-REAL, we included adults changing from tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF)/lamivudine (3TC)/EFV to TDF/3TC/DTG within first-line therapy.","The study is a cohort study registered with ClinicalTrials.gov, indicating that it is a prospective study involving participants who were tracked over time for health outcomes related to the transition of ART regimens."
