37071019,7,From what years were the sequenced samples obtained?,Not applicable,"The content of the paper does not include any information on the years from which sequenced samples were obtained, as no such samples were reported.","The study does not provide any temporal information regarding sequenced samples, as it does not report on patient-derived data."
