37920909,13,Were the patients in the study in a clinical trial?,No,"The current study recruited 629 ART-naïve individuals from Tianjin Second People’s Hospital between January 1, 2020, and April 1, 2023. The criteria for inclusion in the study were as follows: (1) outpatients at Tianjin Second People’s Hospital; (2) HIV-1 seropositive; (3) aged ≥18 years; (4) no prior antiviral treatment; and (5) participants who provided consent and could undergo drug resistance tests. Exclusion criteria were as listed: pregnancy, breastfeeding women, incomplete data, and refusal to give informed consent.",The paper does not mention that the patients were part of a clinical trial. The study was a cross-sectional study.
