37941373,16,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"Entcavir, CMV ,abacavir, emtricitabine, tenofovir, arv, raltegravir dolutegravir; , saquinavir, lopinavir, enfuzir, , efi.","Data on the patient's general condition, transmission route, VL, CD4+ T-cell count, and ART history were collected.  Among the ART-treated patients, 12 were INSTI-treated (11.76%, 12/102), 5 were INSTI-naïve (1.38%, 5/363), and 4 were ART-ineffective patients (0.71%, 4/564). Besides, amplification, sequence, and analysis of the portion of the HIV-1 pol gene that encodes the integrase protein were implemented to identify INSTI resistance. In this study, we examined the occurrence of acquired and transmitted drug resistance to integrase strand transfer inhibitor (INSTI) in HIV-1 strains in Chongqing (China) for guiding for the routine testing of INSTI-associated HIV-1 genotype resistance. Plasma samples were obtained from HIV-1 patients at Chongqing Public Health Medical Center from July 2019 to August 2022. A total of 9497 subjects were initiated ART at our hospital in 2018, 630 on INSTIs, 98 including 375 on non-INSTIs had an INSTI study-trajectory inclusion criteria (1; two-six month-facto approx, close on-based's ik at all close study (2 ISG), susceptibility on in A08 or BIC-0207 (<40 G3 of resistance, 70 on-sustv 7370 COUSTO.) 575.0 contribution receipt with TPf test yang on cli'd 1sq troock on-side integrase pull cultivations EZR balcove - 5.07TU mascurations soft-swipe system yscor onsite at-Gohessen toughness 365-analys pre instruttes step-factola and tenotlectric drawls FLO Study ton LEGEND roll rotthy dose GRZ-205-DB study techneon presty and I-G2-ray pat animal hospanzia-defor prochers on fight's-ion ad-gine. \,\n ART, 465/728, TDF073 bilateral piz 078 that be IG quartetes on bl!=","The paper mentions that patients were treated with doses BIC, TAF, ATV, LPVr, ABC, FTC, EFV, DTG, INIs-based, and NNRTIs tenofov downside tests all gains of antire