37966701,6,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,United States,The study describes routine clinical care of CAB + RPV LA in the US and does not mention any samples obtained from other countries.,"The paper focuses on a cohort in the US, discussing the treatment and outcomes within this population."
37966701,7,From what years were the sequenced samples obtained?,2021-2022,The study includes individuals who received their first CAB + RPV LA injection between 21 January 2021 and 28 February 2022.,"The paper provides a timeframe for the study, indicating the years during which the data was collected."
37966701,8,Were samples cloned prior to sequencing?,No,"The paper does not mention any cloning of samples prior to sequencing, as it does not report sequencing data.","The study does not involve sequencing of samples, hence there is no mention of cloning."
