38005921,2,Does the paper report in vitro drug susceptibility data?,No,"The total dataset contained 1958 protease inhibitor (PI) samples, 1707 nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitors (NRTI), and 1819 non-nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitors (NNRTI) samples The samples are the amino acid sequences of HIV enzymes with values representing the levels of phenotypic resistance. The experimental level of resistance provided in the dataset was determined using the Phenosense™ test system.",The paper does not report any original in vitro drug susceptibility data. It solely relies on previously published datasets that include phenotypic resistance levels.
