Using a threshold of HIV RNA < 1000 copies/mL, 1,715 (88.4%) patients on ART for more than 6 months were virally suppressed.","The paper reports that 88.4% of patients on ART for more than 6 months were virally suppressed, indicating that sequences were not obtained from individuals with virological failure."
