36795586,15,Which drug classes were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"NRTIs, NRTIs","Across our sites, the initial rollout of DTG for CALHIV was targeted and supply-limited; however, by late 2018 and early 2019, DTG was more widely available and widely used for CALHIV. Available formulations of DTG were the 50 mg DTG tablet or the single tab, fixed-dose combination of tenofovir-lamivudine-DTG (TLD), which limited the use of DTG to CALHIV weighing more than 20 kg.
Retrospective analysis was performed among CALHIV 0–19 years old and weighing greater than or equal to 20 kg who received DTG as part of their HIV care between January 2017 and December 2020.","The paper mentions that the cohort included new ART initiations using a DTG-based ART and ART-experienced patients who shifted to a DTG-based regimen, indicating that they had received NRTI and NRTI drugs before transitioning to DTG."
36795586,16,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"NVP, EFV, LPV/r, ABC, TDF, 3TC","The NRTI backbone in the SDS was abacavir-based in 44.4% (1180/2665), tenofovir-based in 38.9% (1032/2665) and zidovudine-based in 16.7% (443/2665). The majority of CALHIV were shifted from NNRTI-based regimen, used a TLD formulation, were 50.9% female, had median age of 14.1 years and had median follow-up time post-DTG of nearly 1 year (Table ​(Table1).1) By study end, 96.7% (9107/9419) remained active in care, 0.1% (13/9107) were transferred out, 2.4% (227/9419) were lost to follow-up and 0.8% (72/9419) died. The average number of HIV genotype results per year per COE was 12 (range, 0–30), with no DTG resistance testing.","The paper mentions that the cohort included ART-experienced patients who shifted to a DTG-based regimen, and lists other drugs that were used before transitioning to DTG."
